      "text": "A 2 s pulse against a 1 s pulse: the 1 s pulse is a window that averages the wider one over each second. The overlap grows linearly for one second, stays complete for one second, then shrinks. A trapezoid, with support $[0, 3]$ and area $2 \\times 1 = 2$."
